{"parentUuid":"fbe44289-e915-4aa4-b21b-a9c5c6ed9c4a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e57db944-5f0f-46d0-9176-157533ac4630","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): allauth-upgrade = local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77 (idle); first-run-flow = local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d (idle); use-a-jusprin-syndicate = local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Looks good. make the launch offer a bit more celebratory. \nShould Account show the plan's price as a line the server writes? - yes. but the info should be passed down from the server, not harcoded in the app.\nalso move the \"delete account\" to the account tab in preferences."}]},"uuid":"8cb2b09b-0a01-425b-b9b1-4074feaa2ca0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T17:01:36.574Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":23,"turnIndex":34},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
