es “Manage plan ↗” and opens the sheet. Bars and usage stay in the app because usage lists chats by their local titles.\",\n    \"“Billing and usage” replaces “Manage plan ↗” and opens the sheet. Usage moved to that page (Kenneth, 2026-11-06); Account keeps the bars, the alert switch and Delete account.\")\nrep(\"'Plan and billing · Billing in the sheet',\", \"'Plan and billing · Billing and usage in the sheet',\")\nrep(\"Named Billing so it is never confused with the app’s Account section, which it points back to for usage.'\",\n    \"Usage per day and per chat moved here from the app (Kenneth, 2026-11-06); the ring’s “See usage” opens this page too. The server doesn’t know chat titles today (account.py names a row by its chat id), but titles are made through the gateway, so it can keep the title it returns. Named so it is never confused with the app’s Account section.'\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Opened from Billing in Account\" tools/composer/build_money_page.py | head -2; cp work-first-run-v2/project/canvas.json /dev/null; python3 tools/composer/build_money_page.py work-first-run-v2/project 2>&1 | tail -4; O=$TMPDIR/money-render3; rm -rf $O; mkdir -p $O; python3 tools/composer/render_dc.py work-first-run-v2 $O $(python3 -c \"import json;print(' '.join(json.load(open('work-first-run-v2/money-boards.json'))))\") >/dev/null 2>&1; ls $O | wc -l"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgn34VBjFrb9qJFUohuuF","requestRef":"7de29500-5331-45d6-802c-369cf1fbda85","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f09f073-7d9e-4647-8d07-e08d1b39e925","timestamp":"2026-11-06T17:04:00.507Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
