{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","hash":"2cb0dcc9e56d58ddd566f5fb3217ab6b1ecc1c425bc1bef766beb10478174c17","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017F1HTeKG3xPHL5N8yeWC8L","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='money-pages-app-server-split-2026-11-06.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:70]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"(version 121)\",\"(version 123)\")\nrep(\"\"\"- The launch offer doubles every credit amount until the end of January: a pack gives 1,000 instead of 500, Hobby 1,500 a month instead of 750, Workshop 2,000 instead of 1,000.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"- The launch offer doubles every credit amount until the end of January: a pack gives 1,000 instead of 500, Hobby 1,500 a month instead of 750, Workshop 2,000 instead of 1,000. It should look celebratory: the boards show a gradient banner, \"Double credits on everything\", and a \"2× launch bonus\" badge with the usual amount struck through on every card.\n- Account shows the plan's price as a line the server sends; no price is hardcoded in the app.\n- Delete account lives at the end of Preferences › Account, not on the server's page.\n- Usage per day and per chat lives on the server's page, now \"Billing and usage\", not in the app.\"\"\")\nrep(\"plan name with the server-written price line, a bar per kind of credit, usage per chat (it needs the chats' local titles), the savings-alert switch. \\\"Get more credits\\\" and \\\"Billing\\\" open the sheet.\",\n    \"plan name with the server-sent price line, a bar per kind of credit, the savings-alert switch, and Delete account (the app's own confirmation dialog, whose sentence the server sends; then DELETE /v2/account and sign out). \\\"Get more credits\\\", the ring's \\\"See usage\\\" and \\\"Billing and usage\\\" open the sheet.\")\nrep(\"- **Billing:** plan in dollars, Change plan, Cancel plan, Chargebee's portal for payment method and invoices, Delete account.\",\n    \"- **Billing and usage:** plan in dollars, Change plan, Cancel plan, Chargebee's portal for payment method and invoices, credits left, and credits used per day and per chat. The server doesn't know chat titles today (`account.py` names a row by its chat id). Titles are generated through the gateway (request kind `title`), so it can keep the title it returns.\")\nrep(\"- **Server-written lines:** the plan's price line and the savings alert.\", \"- **Server-written lines:** the plan's price line, the delete warning and the savings alert.\")\nrep(\"One new field: the plan's price line,\", \"New fields: the plan's price line and the delete warning, each a finished sentence; the price line reads\")\nrep(\"4. **The `suggestion` slot**\", \"4. **DELETE /v2/account** deletes the account; the app then signs out.\\n5. **The `suggestion` slot**\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> /Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/README.md <<'EOF'\nSame day, version 123 (1793984692-0fde), Kenneth: celebratory launch offer (gradient banner + \"2× launch bonus\" badges, struck-through usual amounts), price line sent by the server, Delete account moved to Preferences › Account (new money-10 with the confirmation dialog), usage moved to the server page now titled \"Billing and usage\".\nEOF\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016bomGDpL3PSdFUMRy5BNAw","name":"SendUserFile","input":{"files":["/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/money-review2/money-03-prices-out-of-credits.jpg","/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/money-review2/money-02-prices-signed-out.jpg","/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scr