{"parentUuid":"e789a754-7f2d-426a-af82-e0b5f7290573","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgn4AYYBanGoprHwQqiZS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0161CPPm4BfJeMdjqfrqeUz8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='money-pages-app-server-split-2026-11-06.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:70]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"(version 123)\",\"(version 125)\")\nrep(\"- Usage per day and per chat lives on the server's page, now \\\"Billing and usage\\\", not in the app.\",\n\"\"\"- Usage per day and per chat lives on the server's page, now \"Billing and usage\", not in the app.\n- The app sends each chat's title to the server with its usage, and the server keeps it beside the chat id.\n- The \"tell me when a plan would cost less\" choice sits on the Credit pack card of the pricing page, not in Preferences. Auto-reload is offered there and on Billing and usage.\"\"\")\nrep(\"plan name with the server-sent price line, a bar per kind of credit, the savings-alert switch, and Delete account\",\n    \"plan name with the server-sent price line, a bar per kind of credit, and Delete account\")\nrep(\"Titles are generated through the gateway (request kind `title`), so it can keep the title it returns.\",\n    \"The app sends each chat's current title with its requests and the server stores it beside the chat id; the newest title wins, so renames show. Rows from app versions that send no title need a fallback name.\")\nrep(\"- **Chargebee checkout**, as today.\", \"- **On the Credit pack card:** auto-reload (off until ticked; buys a pack below 50 credits, a placeholder threshold) and the plan-savings alert (on by default).\\n- **Chargebee checkout**, as today.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\necho \"Same day, version 125 (1793985486-00a4): savings-alert choice moved from Account to the Credit pack card; auto-reload on the Cre