 credit, and Delete account\")\nrep(\"Titles are generated through the gateway (request kind `title`), so it can keep the title it returns.\",\n    \"The app sends each chat's current title with its requests and the server stores it beside the chat id; the newest title wins, so renames show. Rows from app versions that send no title need a fallback name.\")\nrep(\"- **Chargebee checkout**, as today.\", \"- **On the Credit pack card:** auto-reload (off until ticked; buys a pack below 50 credits, a placeholder threshold) and the plan-savings alert (on by default).\\n- **Chargebee checkout**, as today.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\necho \"Same day, version 125 (1793985486-00a4): savings-alert choice moved from Account to the Credit pack card; auto-reload on the Credit pack card and on Billing and usage; chat titles sent by the app (Kenneth).\" >> /Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/README.md; echo ok"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgn4AY2vNAWJrvGu47J7B","requestRef":"e16a1021-8a99-4f4d-914d-1ba7f70f2106","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"52caf50b-0e2d-4b03-8478-e9e5dfa2c854","timestamp":"2026-11-06T17:18:14.228Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"52caf50b-0e2d-4b03-8478-e9e5dfa2c854","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5032740b-e27f-4a0d-ac75-b9a46d740f30","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0161CPPm4BfJeMdjqfrqeUz8","type":"tool_result","content":"ok","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bbbe3f16-10e6-4fa6-817e-021528d1d1ee","timestamp":"2026-11-06T17:18:14.579Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/money-pages-app-server-split-2026-11-06.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" # Money pages: which parts the app draws, which the server draws (2026-11-06)"," ","-Boards: canvas https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, page \"Credits & plans\", from y=2900 (version 123). Builder: figma-mirror/tools/composer/build_money_page.py.","+Boards: canvas https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, page \"Credits & plans\", from y=2900 (version 125). Builder: figma-mirror/tools/composer/build_money_page.py."," "," ## Agreed by Kenneth on 2026-11-06"," "]},{"oldStart":10,"oldLines":6,"newStart":10,"newLines":8,"lines":[" - Account shows the plan's price as a line the server sends; no price is hardcoded in the app."," - Delete account lives at the end of Preferences › Account, not on the server's page."," - Usage per day and per chat lives on the server's page, now \"Billing and usage\", not in the app.","+- The app sends each chat's title to the server with its usage, and the server keeps it beside the chat id.","+- The \"tell me when a plan would cost less\" choice sits on the Credit pack card of the pricing page, not in Preferences. Auto-reload is offered there and on Billing and usage."," "," Everything below that is not in this list is a proposal."," "]},{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":14,"newStart":25,"newLines":15,"lines":[" - **The sheet:** its frame, title, \"Open in browser\", close button, loading state and can't-load state. Never the page inside it."," - **Welcome and Home's agent card:** the 500-credit offer and a \"See prices\" link."," - **Composer:** ring and balance panel, credit prices on the model picker, \"About 25 credits left\", the out-of-credits card, \"+1,000 credits\" after buying.","-- **Preferences › Account:** plan name with the server-sent price line, a bar per kind of credit, the savings-alert switch, and Delete account (the app's own confirmation dialog, whose sentence the server sends; then DELETE /v2/account and sign out). \"Get more credits\", the ring's \"See usage\" and \"Billing and usage\" open the sheet.","+- **Preferences › Account:** plan name with the server-sent price line, a bar per kind of credit, and Delete account (the app's own confirmation dialog, whose sentence the server sends; then DELETE /v2/account and sign out). \"Get more credits\", the ring's \"See usage\" and \"Billing and usage\" open the sheet."," - **Print history:** the report button and \"25 credits added\"."," "," Server (jusprinv2.obico.io), shown in the sheet:"," - **Credits and plans**, signed in or signed out.","+- **On the Credit pack card:** auto-reload (off until ticked; buys a pack below 50 credits, a placeholder threshold) and the plan-savings alert (on by default)."," - **Chargebee checkout**, as today."," - **Purchase done:** says what was added and to which account. Its \"Back to your chat\" button goes to the done address.","-- **Billing and usage:** plan in dollars, Change plan, Cancel plan, Chargebee's portal for payment method and invoices, credits left, and credits used per day and per chat. The server doesn't know chat titles today (`account.py` names a row by its chat id). Titles are generated through the gateway (request kind `title`), so it can keep the title it returns.","+- **Billing and usage:** plan in dollars, Change plan, Cancel plan, Chargebee's portal for payment method and invoices, credits left, and credits used per day and per chat. The server doesn't know chat titles today (`account.py` names a row by its chat id). The app sends each chat's current title with its requests and the server stores it beside the chat id; the newest title wins, so renames show. Rows from app versions that send no title need a fallback name."," - **Server-written lines:** the plan's price line, the delete warning and the savings alert."," "," ## The contract (the only part old app versions depend on; proposal)"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/money-pages-app-server-split-2026-11-06.md"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"52caf50b-0e2d-4b03-8478-e9e5dfa2c854","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
