an-savings alert (on by default)."," - **Chargebee checkout**, as today."," - **Purchase done:** says what was added and to which account. Its \"Back to your chat\" button goes to the done address."," - **Billing and usage:** plan in dollars, Change plan, Cancel plan, Chargebee's portal for payment method and invoices, credits left, and credits used per day and per chat. The server doesn't know chat titles today (`account.py` names a row by its chat id). The app sends each chat's current title with its requests and the server stores it beside the chat id; the newest title wins, so renames show. Rows from app versions that send no title need a fallback name."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/money-pages-app-server-split-2026-11-06.md"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"84392e45-b151-4bc7-9c89-d272fc57569f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
