{"parentUuid":"529d07e7-3bf2-46d4-a280-44cfe48fe26b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgn5JxLzjcsCNf1Y2Efrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Above are all eleven boards as they are on the canvas now (version 127), in the order a person meets them:\n\n1. **The map:** what the app draws, what the server draws, and the five things that pass between them.\n2. **The welcome:** \"Sign up and get 500 free credits\", with a \"See prices\" link.\n3. **Prices before signing up:** in the sheet over the welcome, with \"Sign up to buy\" buttons.\n4. **Prices from the out-of-credits card:** the launch banner, and the Credit pack card with auto-reload (below 10 credits) and the savings alert.\n5. **Checkout finished:** \"1,000 credits added\", with the \"Doubled for the launch\" badge.\n6. **Back in the app:** \"+1,000 credits\", Send turned back on, and the typed message still there.\n7. **Preferences › Account:** No plan on the left, Workshop with the price line from the server on the right. Each has Delete account at the end.\n8. **Billing and usage:** the plan, payment method, credits, auto-reload, and usage per day and per chat.\n9. **Change plan, on Hobby:** \"Your plan\" is marked, Workshop's button reads \"Switch to Workshop\", and auto-reload is on.\n10. **Delete account:** the confirmation dialog over Preferences › Account.\n11. **The sheet's own states:** loading, and the server can't be reached."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1150,"cache_read_input_tokens":357131,"output_tokens":449,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1150,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":449,"cache_read