0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Can we insert a blank <div> on the app's account page so that it displays whatever the server passes back, either as part of the account api call, or as a separate api? the div sits near the top of the account page, and is usually hidden when the server doesn't pass back anything.  What I'm thinking about is to have the launch offer promotion shown there as the <div> block during the promotion period."}]}}
